    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">BFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Matrix</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/flood-fill/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 733</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Flood Fill</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The paint-bucket tool. Starting from one pixel, repaint every pixel of the same colour that is reachable through up/down/left/right steps. A DFS or BFS over the grid where the repaint doubles as the visited mark, so no extra matrix is needed - provided you return early when the new colour equals the old one. O(m·n) time.</p>\n"
